     The ssqqpphhyy driver supports the Seeq 80220/80221, 80223, 80225 and 84220
     10/100 Ethernet PHYs.  The 80223 is a 3.3 volt version of the 80221.  The
     80225 is a stripped down version of the 80223.  These PHYs are found on a
     variety of Ethernet interfaces.

